      "description": "<p>The spawn retches up thick, caustic sludge and spits it at a creature within 60 feet, causing equipment and flesh to melt and partially fuse together. The creature must succeed at a DC 23 Reflex save or be Clumsy 2 for 1 minute.</p>",
